    "technical": "~450 kg d fiducial exposure from the first science run; 90% CL pure WIMP-neutron limit 1.8e-2 pb at 55 GeV/c^2; recent Bonn CD nuclear structure calculations indicate xenon is much less sensitive to WIMP-proton spin-dependent interactions than previously thought."
